        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Renée Montagne, Bob Edwards, Steve Inskeep, David Greene\n- Organizations: National Public Radio\n- Products: Morning Edition\n- Roles: radio journalist, co-host, host\n\nFacts:\n- Bob Edwards gained a reputation as the first host of National Public Radio's flagship program, \"Morning Edition\".\n- Renée Montagne is an American radio journalist.\n- From May 2004 to November 11, 2016, Renée Montagne was a co-host of National Public Radio's weekday morning news program, \"Morning Edition,\" alongside Steve Inskeep and David Greene.\n- Renée Montagne's name is pronounced Mon-TAIN.",
